# Web Directory Discovery (WDD)

Simple CLI for directory discovery against a target site.

## Install (editable)

```bash
python -m pip install -e .
```

## Usage

```bash
wdd google.com wordlist.txt
```

### Example

```bash
wdd google.com test.txt
```

Possible output:

```
found: https://google.com/login (302)
```

## Options

- `-o, --output` write found URLs to a file
- `--status` comma-separated status codes treated as found
- `--timeout` request timeout (seconds)
- `--delay` delay between requests (seconds)
- `--user-agent` set a custom User-Agent
